Purananuru transcription attribution

The bundled Purananuru text is transcribed from Tamil Wikisource:
https://ta.wikisource.org/wiki/புறநானூறு

The Wikisource text is identified as CC BY-SA 4.0. The normalized records retain a per-page URL and revision ID in
data/clean/purananuru.json. Attribute the source to Tamil Wikisource
contributors, retain the revision links, and retain the CC BY-SA 4.0 terms
when copying or adapting this transcription:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

The CICT scan URL is retained as edition-reference metadata only. Its scanned
pages were not used to generate the bundled text because OCR could not
reliably separate the poems from commentary.

The current Wikisource transcription omits poems 151–160 (the corresponding
page duplicates poems 161–170), 267–268, 320, and 362. Poem 244 has only an
editorial note stating that its text is damaged. The importer validates and
preserves these omissions rather than fabricating text.
